      "prompt": "Is $\\frac{1}{2}$ equivalent to $\\frac{2}{4}$?",
      "solution": {
        "steps": [
          "Both cover the same amount of a whole.",
          "$\\frac{2}{4}$ simplifies to $\\frac{1}{2}$, so yes they are equivalent."
        ],
        "answer": "Yes"
