      "id": 3,
      "prompt": "Compare $\\frac{1}{2}$ and $\\frac{1}{4}$. Which is greater?",
      "solution": {
        "steps": [
          "Same numerator $1$; the larger piece has the smaller denominator.",
          "$\\frac{1}{2}$ is a bigger piece, so $\\frac{1}{2} > \\frac{1}{4}$."
        ],
        "answer": "$\\frac{1}{2}$"
